<title>USA: Diana holders file suit vs co - attorneys.</title>
<headline>Diana holders file suit vs co - attorneys.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Attorneys for purchasers of Diana Corp common stock during an almost two-year period said a lawsuit has been filed against the company's management.</p>
<p>The lawsuit accuses the management of misleading investors about its product offerings, improperly recording transactions as sales, and participating in schemes to manipulate its stock price while selling the stock at inflated prices.</p>
<p>The company could not immediately be reached for comment.</p>
<p>A similar lawsuit against the company was announced May 12.</p>
